                          "text":  "On July 14, 2015, after nine and a half years, I flew past Pluto at about 14 kilometres every second. I could not slow down or stop. I had a few hours to collect everything. Before me, the best picture of Pluto was a blurry smudge. I showed you ice mountains, blue skies, and a bright heart thousands of kilometres wide.\n\nIt took me more than a year to send all those pictures home, because I am so far away that my connection is very slow.",
